## Working conventions

- **All work happens in linked git worktrees.** The primary checkout never carries an
  authored commit, on any branch — it only advances via `git merge --ff-only`. This is
  enforced fail-closed by the stamped guard pack (see INV-WORKTREE below); override a
  genuine hotfix with `AIOS_ALLOW_PRIMARY_COMMIT=1`.
- **Spec before build** for any non-trivial change; verification (tests + gates) is the
  definition of done, not a narrative claim.
- **Never weaken a gate to make a change ship.** Grandfather lists ratchet down only.

## §8 Invariant registry

Machine-enforced invariants and the stamped tooling that enforces them. Add rows as
this repo grows; never delete a row without deleting the enforcement (and vice versa).

| ID           | Invariant                                                                                                      | Enforced by                                                                                                                                                        |
| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| INV-SIZE     | Every source file ≤ 500 lines (default-deny; `grandfathered` is a per-file ceiling that only ratchets DOWN)     | `scripts/check-file-size.mjs` + `scripts/size-caps.json` — CI job `governance gates`                                                                                 |
| INV-BOUNDARY | Import seams hold: barrels only into `scripts/<cmd>/`, `src/**` never imports `scripts/**`, tests are a leaf    | `scripts/check-boundaries.mjs` + `scripts/boundaries.json` — CI job `governance gates`                                                                               |
| INV-LEAK     | No confidential identifier is ever published; push is the publication event                                     | `scripts/leak-gate.sh` (baseline always on; term set via `AIOS_LEAK_TERMS_B64`/local install) + `hooks/git/pre-push-leak-gate` (installed to `.git/hooks/pre-push`)  |
| INV-WORKTREE | No authored commits or edits in the primary checkout; branch creation there is blocked; worktrees self-hydrate  | `.harness/hooks/git/pre-commit-primary-guard` (strict) + `reference-transaction-strand-guard` + `.harness/hooks/guard-worktree.sh` (wired via `.claude/settings.json`) |

